NOTICE
======

Spell data, cooldowns, icons and ability metadata cached under `resources/`
are scraped from:

  * db.exil.es                 -- Conquest of Azeroth spell database
  * db.ascension.gg            -- Ascension spell database (aowow)
  * ascensionsidekick.com      -- class and spec guides
  * coabuildhub                -- build reference

They are committed so a pack can be rebuilt reproducibly. These are
third-party sites that change without notice and have no API, so a cached
snapshot is the only way to make a build deterministic -- re-scraping is not
guaranteed to return the same data, or any data.

All game data, ability names, spell IDs and icon art remain the property of
their respective owners. World of Warcraft is a trademark of Blizzard
Entertainment. Ascension and Conquest of Azeroth are unaffiliated with
Blizzard Entertainment.

This project is an unofficial community tool. It generates WeakAuras import
strings; it ships no game client code and modifies nothing on any server.

If you own one of the sites above and would prefer the cached data not be
redistributed here, open an issue and it will be removed.
